[E0410] Error: a type argument cannot hold a `&var` reference
    ╭─[ err/68_generic_items/main.wip:44:17 ]
    │
 44 │     val b: Pair<&var i64, i64> = Pair(first: 1, second: 2)
    │                 ────┬───  
    │                     ╰───── a `&var` reference
    │ 
    │ Help: hold `&`, and take `&var` as a parameter where the change is made
    │ 
    │ Note: a `&` reference is kept where a view is, but a `&var` is a parameter's alone: a view may be copied, and two copies of a `&var` would each write one place
